i> Lots of action<br></li><li> Challenges with 2D platforms<br></li><li> Different environments and scenarios to combat<br></li><li> Enemies with different mechanics<br></li><li> Bosses<br></li><li> Various types of weapons<br></li><li> Collectable objects<br></li><li> Characters to interact<br></li><li> Exclusive soundtrack<br></li><li> Fine art in pixel art</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087350/extras/7189ea4cd46e8292c20078daad2bb577.poster.avif?t=1663799079\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087350/extras/7189ea4cd46e8292c20078daad2bb577.webm?t=1663799079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087350/extras/7189ea4cd46e8292c20078daad2bb577.mp4?t=1663799079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
